[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2433439368","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98470#issuecomment-2433439368","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98470","id":2433439368,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RC1aI","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-23T20:50:28Z","updated_at":"2024-10-23T20:50:37Z","body":"As far as I know, one of the features was being able to call vsproj from linux or mac. Does this preserve that?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2433439368/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2434448237","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98470#issuecomment-2434448237","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98470","id":2434448237,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RGrtt","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-24T06:54:43Z","updated_at":"2024-10-24T06:54:43Z","body":"> As far as I know, one of the features was being able to call vsproj from linux or mac. Does this preserve that?\r\n\r\nI am not sure what do you mean. Is there a feature to build godot with vsproj on linux or mac or you are about just generating vsproj file on linux and macos?\r\n\r\nIf the second so it is preserved. The only difference that now you need to explicitly add that your target platform is windows `scons p=\"windows\" vsproj=\"yes\"` but you can still do it on linux and mac. I have linux and tested it before and after PR. It works. But linux/mac users won't be annoyed by `vsproj` options in their `scons -h` output\r\n\r\nIf there is actual building from generated file on linux or mac, I know about it only now and don't know maybe it is preserved `¯\\_(ツ)_/¯`","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2434448237/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2471444547","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98470#issuecomment-2471444547","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98470","id":2471444547,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TT0BD","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-12T19:53:42Z","updated_at":"2024-11-12T19:53:42Z","body":"CC @shana (too many cc for one person in several minutes :sweat: )\r\n\r\nI think this brakes something intended?\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2471444547/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2471678153","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98470#issuecomment-2471678153","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98470","id":2471678153,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TUtDJ","user":{"login":"shana","id":310137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDEzNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/310137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana","html_url":"https://github.com/shana","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-12T22:04:58Z","updated_at":"2024-11-12T22:05:41Z","body":"I don't think this is useful? The option is there in order to generate a VS solution and projects files that can be loaded into IDEs that support the format. You can generate those project files from any platform, not just windows - and technically if an IDE supports the format, it can load them regardless of whether it's on windows or not, the `.sln`/`.vcxproj` formats aren't Windows-specific.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, having the option only on the Windows platform doesn't make sense - you can generate VS projects for all platforms that you can build on Windows. This includes Android out of the box, but also all console platforms. This would break project generation for all other platforms except Windows, which isn't great.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2471678153/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2471709013","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98470#issuecomment-2471709013","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98470","id":2471709013,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TU0lV","user":{"login":"shana","id":310137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDEzNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/310137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana","html_url":"https://github.com/shana","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-12T22:25:48Z","updated_at":"2024-11-12T22:25:48Z","body":"To be clearer, because the word \"Windows\" and \"Platform\" are a bit overloaded: on this laptop that is running Windows 11 right now, I can do the following to generate VS project files:\r\n\r\n- `scons vsproj=yes` : Generates project files to build the editor, assuming `platform=windows`\r\n- `scons platform=android target=template_debug vsproj=yes` : Generates project files to build the debug template for Android\r\n- `scons platform=gdk target=template_debug vsproj=yes` : Generates project files to build the debug template for the custom GDK platform that I have added to my godot source locally\r\n\r\nAs you see, that only works because the `vsproj` option is available for all godot target platforms. If it were only defined on the `windows` platform, it would not be possible to generate project files for any other godot target platform.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2471709013/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]